{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14527","headline":"登楼望月寄凤翔李少尹 · 戴叔伦","name":"登楼望月寄凤翔李少尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陌上凉风槐叶凋，夕阳清露湿寒条。\n登楼望月楚山迥，月到南楼山独遥。\n心送情人趋凤阙，目随阳鴈极烟霄。\n轩辕不重无名客，此地还能访寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}